          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Many Anfield homes still have their original cast iron soil stacks. A crack or failed joint can leak sewage between floors. That is a health risk and needs fixing fast. We carry cast iron repair clamps on the van.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Back Boiler Replacements</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Many Anfield terraces still have an old back boiler behind a gas fire. These are out of date and parts are no longer made. When one fails, it has to be replaced. We take out the back boiler and fit a modern combi. The job usually takes one to two days.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Shared Wall Pipe Leaks</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>In a row of terraces, a leaking pipe can let water into the house next door. Finding the true source matters. We pressure test the pipes and lift floorboards to find it before we open any walls.</p>
        </div>
